1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
TimeScope explores genuine NASA SPHEREx observations through time.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Choose a sky field and inspect repeated observations on a shared sky grid.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Step through dates, blink a pair and compare the same region.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Wavelength and coverage can change appearances.
These are not confirmed detections.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Check the original FITS source and whether metadata or cutouts were reused.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Export the evidence.
Explore change carefully, without claiming a discovery.
